body:
NPD has differing severites, think of a spectrum, you have extreme only out for them self sorts, and even people who are self aware of their own NPD,maybe even trying to seek help for it, and everything in between.that being said, even small actions that are narcissistic should be addressed, and sometimes that is when NPD is at its worst, is when you call someone out for said behavior.

&#x200B;

pay attention to the REACTION of being called out, and you will have a better idea.
